[5,0,6,7,4],[5],[2],[2,3,1],[2,7],[6,2]]"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[[1],[0]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[3,1,4,2],[4,2,3,6,0],[1,4,5,0,6],[1,0],[5,6,2,1,0],[4,6,2],[1,4,2,5]]"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[[2,3],[4,3,2],[1,4,3,0],[0,4,2,1],[3,2,1]]"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[[9,2,8],[6,5],[0,3],[2,4],[5,3],[6,4,1],[7,1,5],[6],[0],[0]]"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[[3],[2,3],[1,7,8,5],[0,1,7,5,8,4],[9,3],[6,2,3],[8,5],[3,2],[6,2,3],[4]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[11,9,14,1,4],[8,11,7,2,0,9],[15,11,1],[4,14],[0,3,14,16,9],[13,16],[15,13,12],[1,10,9,15],[1,10,12],[12,1,15,4,0,7],[11,8,7,12],[0,10,1,2],[9,6,8,10],[16,6,5],[16,4,3,0],[6,7,9,2],[13,5,14,4]]"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[[],[],[],[],[],[15],[],[],[],[],[],[],[15],[],[],[5,12],[],[]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[1,2],[0],[6,0,5],[5,6],[6,5],[7,4,2,3],[7,3,4,2],[6,5]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[6,3,7],[2,7],[7,6,1],[0],[7],[8],[7,0,2],[6,4,1,8,0,2],[7,5]]"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[[],[10],[],[7],[],[13],[],[3],[],[],[17,1],[],[],[5],[],[],[],[10],[]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[8,4],[4,8],[4,8],[4,8],[9,5,6,2,3,0,1,7],[8,4],[8,4],[4,8],[0,2,9,1,5,3,6,7],[8,4]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[],[13,12,5],[14,10],[8],[12],[10,15,1],[15],[12],[15,3],[],[2,5,11],[14,10],[15,4,1,7],[1],[2,11],[12,6,8,5]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[],[],[6],[],[],[],[2],[],[],[],[]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[2],[2],[0,1]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[4],[],[4,11,9,3,14],[2,10],[0,2],[11],[9],[],[12],[2,6,10],[9,3],[15,5,2,17],[8,19],[14],[13,2],[11],[],[11],[],[12]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[2],[],[0]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[],[],[7],[6,13],[],[8],[3],[2],[5],[13,10],[9],[],[],[3,9]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[3,1],[0],[],[0]]"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[[],[18],[3],[16,2,7],[],[],[18],[17,3],[10,19,21],[23,27,20],[8,26],[26],[],[21],[18],[16],[17,3,15],[7,16],[14,6,1],[8],[9],[13,8],[],[24,25,9],[23,26],[23],[11,24,10],[9]]"],"out":"true","g":1}],"lesson":"advanced-graphs","statement":"You are given an undirected graph with `n` nodes numbered `0` to `n − 1` as an adjacency list: `graph[u]` holds every node that shares an edge with `u`. The graph has no self-loops or repeated edges, and edges are listed in both directions (if `v` is in `graph[u]`, then `u` is in `graph[v]`). The graph may be made of several disconnected parts.\n\nA graph is **bipartite** if its nodes can be split into two groups A and B such that every edge connects a node in A with a node in B.\n\nReturn `true` if the graph is bipartite, otherwise `false`.","constraints":["n == graph.length","1 <= n <= 100","0 <= graph[u].length < n","0 <= graph[u][i] <= n − 1","graph[u] does not contain u, and its values are distinct","If graph[u] contains v, then graph[v] contains u"],"hints":["Try to colour every node with one of two colours so that neighbours always differ. When does that become impossible?","Start at any uncoloured node, give it colour 1, and BFS or DFS: each neighbour gets the opposite colour. If you reach a neighbour that already has the same colour as the current node, the graph is not bipartite.","The graph can be disconnected, so start a new search from every node that is still uncoloured. A graph is bipartite exactly when it has no cycle of odd length."],"explain":"In `[[1,2,3],[0,2],[0,1,3],[0,2]]`, nodes 0, 1 and 2 are all joined to each other: a triangle. Whichever groups 0 and 1 go into, they must differ, and then 2 must differ from both, which is impossible with two groups. So the answer is `false`."},
